<article class="help-article p-4">
    <header class="help-article-header mb-4">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined help-article-icon">tune</span>
        <h1 class="help-article-title">Preferences</h1>
        <p class="help-article-lead">
            Preferences store application-wide settings for generated project metadata, project handling,
            export behavior, and AI providers.
        </p>
    </header>

    <h2 class="help-heading">General and projects</h2>
    <ul class="help-list">
        <li><strong>Company Name</strong> &mdash; used throughout generated or scaffolded project metadata.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete project folders automatically</strong> &mdash; removes project folders from disk when deleting projects, if enabled.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete mapping model files automatically</strong> &mdash; removes the generated <code>.cdm</code> file for a mapping model when deleting the map. This option is disabled by default and never removes frozen <code>.mom</code> versions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="help-heading">AI providers</h2>
    <p>
        The AI section lists configured providers, their endpoint URLs, API keys, and available models.
        Add, edit, or delete providers here before using the Editor Copilot.
    </p>

    <div class="help-callout">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">warning</span>
        <div>
            <strong>File deletion is permanent.</strong>
            Leave automatic deletion off unless removing a project or mapping model should also remove its files from disk.
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>
        See <a class="help-link" href="#mapping-models" data-help-anchor="mapping-models">Mapping Models</a>
        for details about creating, writing, and removing migration maps.
    </p>
</article>
